    "selection_rationale": [
      "The known 10% w/w Caraway stock permits exact active accounting; 40 uL total stock equals only 4 uL active in the concentrate.",
      "Cardamom remains over fifty times larger by raw active dose, while lavender/linalool/Hedione frame the caraway as an aromatic shadow instead of a food spice.",
      "Cedar and Vertofix were selected as dry continuations; coriander, anise, clove, cumin-like materials, tobacco, and balsams were rejected as culinary or genre-changing.",
      "EB stays the sole structural musk and is not increased."
    ],
    "drift_risk": "Any larger caraway, coriander/anise reinforcement, sweet balsam, or missing cardamom contrast could produce savory rye, cumin, or culinary drift."
  },
